select public.admin_notify('🔌 D65: DM server tak pahuncha hi nahi — CONNECT step (Login URL Allow) ab retry', 'Owner: "Nhi hua kuch". Server-side sach: ig_dm_messages me owner ke test DM ki koi row NAHI (sirf D47 ka purana test row) ⇒ Meta ka webhook deliver hi nahi hua. Tokens (permissions) maujood hain, webhook subscription active+messages field bhi, hub v2 bhi tayyar — jo missing hai wo CONNECT step: Instagram account ka app se OAuth connection (Login URL → Allow), jo webhook delivery chalu karta hai; Add-account flow sirf tester token deta hai. App ab Live + sab clean hai, isliye D65 guide: (1) config page se Login URL copy → usi Chrome (developer FB login) me kholo → portfolio Mini eSports → IG login zone_queen_55 → permissions → Allow → miniesports.local error page = success; (2) Login URL dobara → mini_esports_official se login → Allow; (3) phir teesre account se zone_queen_55 ko "how to join" DM → 10 sec me auto-reply; (4) agar Login URL phir "App not active" dikhaye to turant screenshot, kuch aur mat karo; (5) grant success par DM phir bhi silent ho to owner "bheja" likhe — agent agla turn server live dekhega. Scraping/i.instagram.com se IG ids nahi mile (login wall); subscribed_apps probe IDs milne par reserved.', 'session_end') as notified;
